  "post_content": "<p>El Ateneo y el caf&eacute; rock La Oveja Negra de Onda han vivido un jueves de lo m&aacute;s cultural, con una conferencia de Helios Jaime sobre Richard Wagner y la presentaci&oacute;n del libro Historias desde la almoada, respectivamente.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2110.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El autor de Historias desde la almoada, Javier Garcia Mart&iacute;nez, es de Onda y actualmente reside en Vila-real, Le han acompa&ntilde;ado en la presnetaci&oacute;n las representantes de Ediciones Ortiz. El libro es una recopilacion de relatos cortos que el actor pretende que &quot;lleguen al alma y al coraz&oacute;n&quot;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2130.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Richard Wagner: Una nueva visi&oacute;n de su obra era el t&iacute;tulo de la conferencia pronunciada por Helios Jaime, profesor de Literatura comparada en la Universidad de Par&iacute;s-Sorbone en el Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de la calle Ecce Homo. Ha presentado el acto Concha P&iacute;&ntilde;&oacute;n, vocal de la entidad.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2107.jpg\" alt=\"img_2107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2108.jpg\" alt=\"img_2108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2109.jpg\" alt=\"img_2109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2110.jpg\" alt=\"img_2110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2111.jpg\" alt=\"img_2111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2112.jpg\" alt=\"img_2112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2113.jpg\" alt=\"img_2113\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2114.jpg\" alt=\"img_2114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2115.jpg\" alt=\"img_2115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2116.jpg\" alt=\"img_2116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2117.jpg\" alt=\"img_2117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2118.jpg\" alt=\"img_2118\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2119.jpg\" alt=\"img_2119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2121.jpg\" alt=\"img_2121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2122.jpg\" alt=\"img_2122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijous141113ateneulaovejaonda/img_2130.jpg\" alt=\"img_2130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
